==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1'''===
[[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] or [[Crazed Bird Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed UFO Cat]] can be spammed alongside meatshields to defeat General GreGory.

Alternatively, using [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] (once again, with meatshields) makes quick work of GreGory.

==='''Chapter 2'''===
Use any decent [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] ([[Skirt Cat (Special Cat)|Loincloth Cat]], [[Evil Cat (Rare Cat)|Gentleman Bros.]], [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Kendo Cat]], etc.) to break the initial two UltraBaaBaas' [[Barrier]]s. If the Barrier Breakers don't manage to kill the UltraBaaBaas, use a ranged attacker like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]] to finish them off. Once the way has been cleared, send in [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] with meatshields to kill the General GreGory and emerge victorious.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
With the right levels, [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]] will carry you through this stage. Crowd-Controllers like [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]] or [[Psychocat (Rare Cat)|Corrupted Psychocat]] can also be used against the Mesocosmocyclones.

